PROJECT 1 — ALPHAINVEST CORE
Market Data + Quantitative ML/DL Intelligence Engine


Main objective:- 
Build the data and predictive intelligence foundation of AlphaInvest.

It should answer:
What is happening with a stock, sector, index, portfolio and overall market?

Data

MARKET
├── OHLCV
├── Intraday
├── Volume
├── Corporate Actions
├── Indices
├── Futures
├── Options
└── Market Breadth


FUNDAMENTALS
├── Revenue
├── EBITDA
├── EPS
├── Debt
├── Cash Flow
├── ROE / ROCE
├── P/E / P/B
├── Dividends
├── Shareholding
└── Earnings


MACRO
├── Inflation
├── Interest Rates
├── Bond Yields
├── Currency
├── Crude
├── Gold
├── VIX
├── FII / DII
└── Global Markets


