Outputs

Instead of only:
Predicted price = ₹X

produce:
STOCK INTELLIGENCE
Trend              Bullish
Momentum           Strong
Volatility         Medium
Fundamental        82/100
Technical          76/100
Risk               41/100

30-DAY SCENARIOS
Bull                +18%
Base                 +8%
Bear                 -12%
Stress               -25%

Confidence            72%


Market Regime Detection
Detect:-

Bull
Bear
Sideways
High volatility
Low volatility
Panic
Recovery
Liquidity stress

This makes the ML system considerably more sophisticated than a generic Kaggle stock predictor.

Quantitative Market Intelligence & Predictive Analytics Engine

This is your Data Science + ML + DL + Quant project.

It handles:

Market data
Fundamentals
Technical analysis
Macroeconomics
Time-series forecasting
ML/DL prediction
Market regime detection
Volatility
Risk
Portfolio analytics
Backtesting
Scenario modelling
Core question:

“What is happening in the market, and what could happen next?”




